"Persona store (%s, %s) requires the following details:\n"
"    contact (provided: ‘%s’)\n"
msgstr ""
"Persona-lageret (%s, %s) krev desse opplysningane:\n"
"    kontakt (oppgitt: «%s»)\n"

#: backends/telepathy/lib/tpf-persona-store.vala:1324
