msgstr ""
"Klarte ikkje endre favoritt utan tilkopling til telepathy-logger-tenesta."

#: backends/telepathy/lib/tpf-persona-store.vala:1368
msgid ""
"Failed to change favorite status of Telepathy Persona because it has no "
